# Runtime artifacts
#
# Pre-mortem artifacts (per reasoning-gates.v1.json: artifact_storage.type)
# are transient structured JSON files written here at runtime, then
# referenced from the Task Ledger. They are NOT cognitive events by
# default, and NOT epistemic records by default.
#
# Naming convention: <task_id>_<timestamp>.json
# Example: 2026-08-11-premortem_20260811T120000Z.json
#
# Schema version: 1.0.0 (per reasoning-gates.v1.json contract)
#
# Cleanup: these files are transient. Operators may prune old artifacts
# to keep the directory manageable; durable outcomes flow through the
# memory-admission gate as cognitive events / epistemic records.
